# High-Value Exam Traps

## Trap #1

Requirement:

> VNet-B cannot resolve names in a Private DNS Zone

Wrong Answer:

❌ Create VNet Peering

Correct Answer:

✅ Create a DNS Zone Link

---

## Trap #2

Requirement:

> Internal users and external users should resolve different IPs for the same hostname

Correct Answer:

✅ Split-Brain DNS

---

## Trap #3

Requirement:

> Automatically create DNS records for Azure VMs

Correct Answer:

✅ Auto Registration

---

## Trap #4

Requirement:

> Route email delivery

Correct Answer:

✅ MX Record

---

## Trap #5

Requirement:

> Create an alias to another hostname

Correct Answer:

✅ CNAME Record

